changeling-shock-hand-examine = A faint glow emanates from their hands.

evolutionmenu-organic-sequencer-name = Organic access breaker
evolutionmenu-organic-sequencer-desc = Unlock doors and erase access from digital locks with a touch, like an access breaker. Costs 30 chemicals per successful hack.
evolutionmenu-shock-hand-name = Electrified hand
evolutionmenu-shock-hand-desc = Grow an electrified hand that deals 35 stamina damage per strike for 10 chemicals. Your hands emit a faint glow while active.

changeling-breathing-enabled = We resume breathing.
changeling-breathing-disabled = We no longer need to breathe.
evolutionmenu-utility-breathing-name = Respiratory Control
evolutionmenu-utility-breathing-desc = Choose whether your body needs to breathe. While breathing is stopped, you cannot inhale gases or suffocate. You start out breathing normally. Costs no chemicals or biomass.
